    </div>
    <details>
      <summary>Tutor transcript and evidence notes</summary>
      <ol>
        <li><span class="ex">The instructions sound clear.</span> Evidence target: adjective complement evaluating the instructions.</li>
        <li><span class="ex">The coordinator explained them clearly.</span> Evidence target: manner after the short object.</li>
        <li><span class="ex">The volunteer worked hard all morning.</span> Evidence target: great effort.</li>
        <li><span class="ex">We could hardly hear the announcement.</span> Evidence target: almost not.</li>
        <li><span class="ex">The hallway is crowded, so go slow near the door.</span> Evidence target: recognized informal U.S. flat form.</li>
        <li><span class="ex">Maya carefully opened the fragile package.</span> Evidence target: manner before the verb, framing the whole action.</li>
      </ol>
    </details>
  </section>

  <h2>Read the fictional setup review</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Harbor workshop observation</h3>
    <p><span class="ex">The setup looked organized at 8:30. Maya explained the safety steps clearly, and the new volunteers listened carefully. They worked hard, but they did not rush. One automatic door closed slowly because a box was near its sensor. Maya carefully moved the box away. After that, the door worked well, and the team finished on time.</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You followed qualities, manners, effort, a preverb adverb, and the result of the fictional setup review.">
    <h3>Reading check: use only the observation</h3>
    <div class="quiz-list">
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="organized" data-hint="Looked links the setup to its evaluated quality at 8:30." data-fix="The setup looked organized."><p class="quiz-question">1. Which word describes the quality of the setup rather than the manner of an action?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="organized">organized</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="clearly">clearly</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="carefully">carefully</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="They listened carefully and did not rush." data-hint="The observation names careful listening and explicitly says they did not rush." data-fix="They listened carefully and did not rush."><p class="quiz-question">2. What evidence shows that the volunteers avoided careless speed?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="They listened carefully and did not rush.">They listened carefully and did not rush.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="They arrived after the expected time.">They arrived after the expected time.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="They could hardly hear Maya.">They could hardly hear Maya.</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="before moved" data-hint="The observation says Maya carefully moved the box away." data-fix="Carefully appears before moved."><p class="quiz-question">3. Where does <span class="ex">carefully</span> appear in the sentence about Maya and the box?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="before moved">before moved</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="between moved and the box">between moved and the box</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="after away">after away</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="The door worked well, and the team finished on time." data-hint="Use the final sentence after Maya moves the box." data-fix="The door worked well, and the team finished on time."><p class="quiz-question">4. What happened after Maya moved the box?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The door worked well, and the team finished on time.">The door worked well, and the team finished on time.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The door continued closing slowly all day.">The door continued closing slowly all day.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The volunteers stopped working.">The volunteers stopped working.</button></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-quiz>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-quiz>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <h2>Build two natural action descriptions</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="the coordinator explained the safety steps clearly" data-hint="Keep explained beside its object the safety steps, then place clearly at the end." data-fix="The coordinator explained the safety steps clearly." data-success-message="Correct. The short object stays beside explained, and clearly gives the manner at the end.">
    <h3>Drill 4: neutral end position</h3><p class="tile-target">Report that the coordinator’s explanation was clear.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank><button class="tile" data-build-tile="safety">safety</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="coordinator">coordinator</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="clearly">clearly</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="the">The</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="steps">steps</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="explained">explained</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="the">the</button></div>
    <div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap words in order"></div><div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="maya carefully opened the fragile package" data-hint="Place carefully before opened because the cue asks you to foreground care across the action." data-fix="Maya carefully opened the fragile package." data-success-message="Correct. Carefully comes before opened and foregrounds the manner of the whole action.">
    <h3>Drill 5: purposeful preverb position</h3><p class="tile-target">Foreground Maya’s care while she opened a fragile package.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank><button class="tile" data-build-tile="package">package</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="carefully">carefully</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="maya">Maya</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="fragile">fragile</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="opened">opened</button><button class="tile" data-build-tile="the">the</button></div>
    <div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap words in order"></div><div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-build>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-build>Reset</button></div><p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <h2>Notice and repair three different errors</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="clearly" data-hint="Sound links the instructions to a quality in this sentence." data-fix="The instructions sound clear." data-why="Use the adjective clear after the linking meaning of sound; the instructions do not perform an action clearly." data-success-message="Correct. The linking meaning takes the adjective clear.">
    <h3>Drill 6: repair a linking complement</h3><p>The reviewer evaluates the instructions: <span class="ex">The instructions sound clearly.</span> Tap the form that does not match that meaning.</p><div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="instructions">The instructions</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="sound">sound</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="clearly">clearly</button></div><p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="hardly" data-hint="The report intends great effort, not almost no work." data-fix="The volunteers worked hard all morning." data-why="Hard means with great effort; hardly means almost not and reverses the intended amount of work." data-success-message="Correct. Great effort requires hard, not hardly.">
    <h3>Drill 7: preserve effort meaning</h3><p>The report intends sustained effort: <span class="ex">The volunteers worked hardly all morning.</span> Tap the word that creates the wrong meaning.</p><div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="volunteers">The volunteers</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="worked">worked</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="hardly">hardly</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="morning">all morning</button></div><p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="carefully" data-hint="The neutral short-object pattern keeps explained beside the route." data-fix="Maya explained the route carefully." data-why="For neutral end placement, keep explained and its short object the route together, then add carefully." data-success-message="Correct. The neutral repair keeps the verb and short object together.">
    <h3>Drill 8: keep the short object beside the verb</h3><p>The editor requests neutral end placement: <span class="ex">Maya explained carefully the route.</span> Tap the word that must move.</p><div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="maya">Maya</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="explained">explained</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="carefully">carefully</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="route">the route</button></div><p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="micro-drill" data-transform>
    <h3>Oral transforms: preserve the intended target and manner</h3>
    <p>Say each complete new sentence before revealing it. Follow the requested meaning and position.</p>
    <div class="transform-list">
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>1</b> <span class="ex">Maya is a careful worker.</span> Describe how she checks the list.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>Maya checks the list carefully.</strong></p></div>
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>2</b> <span class="ex">The explanation was clear.</span> Use <span class="ex">explained</span> and put the manner at the end.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>The coordinator explained it clearly.</strong></p></div>
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>3</b> <span class="ex">The team’s performance was good.</span> Use <span class="ex">performed</span>.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>The team performed well.</strong></p></div>
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>4</b> The volunteers used great effort. Use <span class="ex">worked</span>.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>The volunteers worked hard.</strong></p></div>
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>5</b> The instructions have a clear quality. Use the linking verb <span class="ex">sound</span>.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>The instructions sound clear.</strong></p></div>
      <div class="transform-item" data-transform-item><p class="transform-cue"><b>6</b> <span class="ex">Maya opened the fragile package carefully.</span> Foreground the manner before the action.</p><button class="lesson-btn" data-reveal-transform>Reveal after you answer</button><p class="transform-answer" data-transform-answer><strong>Maya carefully opened the fragile package.</strong></p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Communicate: observe a fictional setup team</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <p class="note-line">You never need to disclose your real work, school, home, location, schedule, abilities, performance, health, finances, family, relationships, travel, mistakes, habits, or personal opinions. Use the Harbor workshop, invent a neutral team, or share personal information only when you freely choose.</p>
  <div class="prompt-card"><b>Prepare the observation:</b> Choose four fictional actions such as explaining a route, moving equipment, greeting visitors, checking a list, or closing a door. Give each action a specific manner.</div>
  <div class="prompt-card"><b>Final production: give a 45–60 second fictional observation briefing.</b> Include two adjective descriptions, three <span class="ex">-ly</span> manner adverbs, one of <span class="ex">well, fast, hard</span>, or <span class="ex">late</span>, one neutral end-position adverb, and one purposeful preverb adverb.</div>
  <div class="prompt-card"><b>Meaning check:</b> Ask the listener one question about an entity quality and one question about action manner. Then correct one possible misunderstanding with contrastive stress.</div>

  <h2>Final check</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You controlled adjective complements, manner meaning, hard versus hardly, neutral object order, and purposeful preverb placement.">
    <h3>Four decisions with one defensible target</h3>
    <div class="quiz-list">
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="The instructions sound clear." data-hint="Sound evaluates the quality of the instructions in this context." data-fix="The instructions sound clear."><p class="quiz-question">1. The reviewer evaluates the instructions’ quality. Which sentence matches that linking meaning?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The instructions sound clear.">The instructions sound clear.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The instructions sound clearly.">The instructions sound clearly.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="The instructions clearly sound.">The instructions clearly sound.</button></div></div>
