      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Maya explained the route clearly." data-hint="Neutral placement keeps explained beside the short object the route." data-fix="Maya explained the route clearly."><p class="quiz-question">3. The editor requests neutral end placement with the short object kept beside its verb. Which sentence matches?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Maya explained the route clearly.">Maya explained the route clearly.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Maya explained clearly the route.">Maya explained clearly the route.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Maya explained the clearly route.">Maya explained the clearly route.</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="Maya carefully opened the fragile package." data-hint="The requested focus places carefully before opened to frame the whole action." data-fix="Maya carefully opened the fragile package."><p class="quiz-question">4. The writer wants care to frame the whole package-opening action before naming it. Which sentence matches that requested focus?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Maya carefully opened the fragile package.">Maya carefully opened the fragile package.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Maya opened carefully the fragile package.">Maya opened carefully the fragile package.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="Maya careful opened the fragile package.">Maya careful opened the fragile package.</button></div></div>
    </div>
