  <h2>Reflect and retrieve</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Explain the decision path without looking back</h3>
    <p>What does the description point at? Is the verb linking the subject to a quality or naming an action? Which spelling pattern or stored form applies? Does the sentence need neutral end position, purposeful preverb position, or a frequency-plus-manner order?</p>
  </div>
  <p class="note-line">Return tomorrow before rereading. Complete the <a href="#next-day-retrieval">five-minute next-day retrieval</a>, then revisit only the target, form, meaning contrast, placement, or spoken stress that still feels slow.</p>

